@PersonalBudgetTrackerAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5214
@Token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Create a Role (Admin)
POST {{PersonalBudgetTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/create-role
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "roleName": "Admin"
}

### 2. Register a User
POST {{PersonalBudgetTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!",
    "fullName": "Test User"
}

### 3. Assign Role to User
POST {{PersonalBudgetTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/assign-role
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "roleName": "Admin"
}

### 4. Login (This will return the JWT Token)
POST {{PersonalBudgetTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "Password123!"
}

### 5. Access an [Authorize] Endpoint
GET {{PersonalBudgetTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Categories
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 6. Access an [Authorize(Roles = "Admin")] Endpoint
POST {{PersonalBudgetTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Categories
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Salary",
    "description": "Monthly income"
}
